<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The key documents include the GST e‑Way bill, the IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty), and a comprehensive 100% declared‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance.</span></li></ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The <strong>GST e‑Way bill</strong> is an electronic waybill issued by the Goods and Services Tax portal.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>It authorises the transport of goods across state borders and ensures compliance with tax regulations.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>For a <strong>movers &amp; packers to move household from Ahmedabad to Vadodara</strong>, the e‑Way bill must be generated before the load leaves the city and scanned onto the vehicle’s GPS‑enabled dashboard for real‑time tracking.</span></li></ul>

<p>The <strong>IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty)</strong> is the official proof of ownership of the goods during transit. It lists every item, its value, and the consignor and consignee details. This document is vital for <strong>packers and movers in Maninagar Ahmedabad</strong> as it serves as the legal basis for claiming any loss or damage.</p>

<p>To cover risks that arise during the move, the freight operator typically purchases <strong>100% declared‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance</strong>. Even though the route is inland, the insurance is classified under marine transit for standardisation.</p>
<p>It covers accidental collisions, theft, and unforeseen delays such as traffic snarls or weather disruptions. This policy ensures that the full declared value of your household items is reimbursed in the event of loss, giving you peace of mind when you choose a reputable service like <strong>Vishwakarma Cargo Packers and Movers Ahmedabad</strong>.</p>

